<section class="space-y-6">
  <header class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">Gem in a Box Guide</h2>
    <p class="text-base-content/70">Everything you need to configure the CLI, publish gems, and automate workflows.</p>
  </header>

  <article class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="intro card bg-base-200 shadow-lg">
      <div class="card-body space-y-3 text-sm">
        <h3 class="card-title text-xl">Add this gem server</h3>
        <p class="hint text-base-content/70">Add this server to your Gemfile, then paste gem lines from the index into the block</p>
        <pre class="command snippet rounded-box bg-base-100 p-4 font-mono"><code>source "<%= h(url("/")) %>" do
  gem "..."
end</code></pre>
        <p class="hint text-base-content/70">Credentials: your install-only htpasswd user. Ask an admin for one.</p>
        <pre class="command rounded-box bg-base-100 p-4 font-mono"><code>bundle config set --global <%= h(URI(url("/")).host) %> username:password</code></pre>
        <p class="hint text-base-content/70">Without Bundler</p>
        <pre class="command rounded-box bg-base-100 p-4 font-mono"><code>gem install GEMNAME --source <%= h(url("/")) %></code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card bg-base-200 shadow-lg">
      <div class="card-body space-y-4">
        <h3 class="card-title text-xl">Upload from the CLI</h3>
        <div class="rounded-box bg-base-100 p-4 font-mono text-sm">
          <pre><code>gem install geminabox
gem build your_gem.gemspec
gem inabox pkg/your_gem-0.1.0.gem</code></pre>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">Use <code>gem inabox --host <%= url "/" %></code> to target this server explicitly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card bg-base-200 shadow-lg md:col-span-2">
      <div class="card-body space-y-4">
        <h3 class="card-title text-xl">Tips</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm text-base-content/70">
          <li><code>ADMIN_USER</code> and <code>ADMIN_PASS</code> sign in to this UI and are the only credentials that can push, upload, or delete gems.</li>
          <li>Install-only users live in an htpasswd file: <code>GEMINABOX_HTPASSWD</code>, or <code><%= h(File.join(Geminabox.data, 'config', 'htpasswd')) %></code>. Add one with <code>htpasswd -B &lt;file&gt; &lt;user&gt;</code>. Only bcrypt (<code>-B</code>) entries work. Changes apply without a restart.</li>
          <li>Install-only users can download gems and read the index. They cannot sign in to this UI.</li>
          <li>Automations push with Basic auth (<code>ADMIN_USER</code>/<code>ADMIN_PASS</code>) against <code>/upload</code> and <code>/api/v1/gems</code>.</li>
          <li>Back up the `<%= Geminabox.data %>` directory to retain all gems and indexes.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <footer class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4">
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="<%= url("/") %>">← Back to index</a>
    <% if @allow_upload %>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="<%= url("/upload") %>">Upload a gem</a>
    <% end %>
  </footer>
</section>
